  "metadata": {
    "name": "Fluorescent Dissolved Organic Matter Measurements from the Mackenzie Shelf and Beaufort Sea, 2019",
    "description": "Dataset containing in-situ measurements of fluorescent dissolved organic matter (fDOM) and intrinsic fluorescence (IFDOM) parameters collected from 146 station samples across 4 expeditions in the Mackenzie River plume region and adjacent Beaufort Sea during 2019. Measurements include FDOM peak intensities (A-peak, C-peak, M-peak, T-peak), intrinsic fluorescence components (C1, C2, C3), and fluorescence indices (FI, HI, BI) at various stations along the Mackenzie Shelf.",
